WEBVTT

00:00:00.320 --> 00:01:35.400
[ Watch on kissFlix.co ]

00:01:35.850 --> 00:01:39.789
[Abyss]

00:01:42.690 --> 00:01:43.500
San,

00:01:43.820 --> 00:01:45.220
are you really from the Northeast?

00:01:45.220 --> 00:01:47.820
Your accent doesn't really sound like it
to me.

00:01:48.050 --> 00:01:49.470
I used to have a few coworkers
from the Northeast.

00:01:49.470 --> 00:01:50.270
Oh man,

00:01:50.340 --> 00:01:51.570
just a few words from them,

00:01:51.570 --> 00:01:52.810
and my accent was led astray.

00:01:52.810 --> 00:01:54.539
After living in a workers' dorm
with them for over a week,

00:01:54.539 --> 00:01:56.780
they had me speaking with
a Northeast accent now.

00:01:56.780 --> 00:01:58.380
You do sound a bit like it now.

00:01:58.700 --> 00:02:00.180
I'm not from the Northeast.

00:02:00.180 --> 00:02:01.230
I'm from De'ermu.

00:02:01.870 --> 00:02:03.330
You know De'ermu?

00:02:03.400 --> 00:02:04.050
You don't?

00:02:04.050 --> 00:02:05.160
Well, let me tell you about it.

00:02:05.160 --> 00:02:07.100
De'ermu is a very tiny place.

00:02:07.120 --> 00:02:08.789
There aren't many people there.

00:02:08.789 --> 00:02:10.620
At its peak, my village only had

00:02:10.729 --> 00:02:11.840
a little over 20 households.

00:02:11.840 --> 00:02:13.090
I haven't been back in years, though,

00:02:13.090 --> 00:02:14.150
so I don't know what it's like now.

00:02:14.150 --> 00:02:15.470
Laifu, do you think there's anyone
in your village

00:02:15.470 --> 00:02:16.810
who still remembers you?

00:02:16.810 --> 00:02:17.810
Probably not.

00:02:17.840 --> 00:02:18.710
There's only

00:02:18.710 --> 00:02:19.960
me and my older sister left in my family.

00:02:19.960 --> 00:02:23.570
I've actually been thinking about
going back to see her for the New Year.

00:02:23.570 --> 00:02:25.180
Well, you should.

00:02:25.280 --> 00:02:27.230
Otherwise, after all these years away,

00:02:27.230 --> 00:02:29.260
no one would even know
whether you're alive or dead.

00:02:29.260 --> 00:02:30.940
Oh, give me a break.
It's not like I struck it rich.

00:02:30.940 --> 00:02:32.000
Who'd even miss me?

00:02:32.050 --> 00:02:33.650
If my sister saw me like this,

00:02:33.670 --> 00:02:34.370
she'd definitely say,

00:02:34.370 --> 00:02:35.120
"What did you come back for?

00:02:35.120 --> 00:02:36.920
You might as well die out there."

00:02:39.780 --> 00:02:40.530
It can't be that bad.

00:02:40.530 --> 00:02:41.650
Is she your biological sister?

00:02:41.650 --> 00:02:43.500
Of course she is.

00:02:43.530 --> 00:02:45.329
But my sister is nothing like me.

00:02:45.430 --> 00:02:47.290
I treat money like dirt,

00:02:47.320 --> 00:02:48.920
but she's all about the cash.

00:02:52.200 --> 00:02:52.930
That's good.

00:02:54.110 --> 00:02:55.930
Then you should talk to me more.

00:02:55.960 --> 00:02:57.710
You don't seem like much of a talker.

00:02:57.710 --> 00:02:59.110
You've been here for almost a week, right?

00:02:59.110 --> 00:03:00.180
And I've barely heard you

00:03:00.180 --> 00:03:01.200
say anything about yourself.

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:02.280
You're way too introverted.
That's not good.

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:03.570
Look at me—I'm completely different.

00:03:03.570 --> 00:03:04.830
I love talking.

00:03:04.860 --> 00:03:05.840
Even if others ignore me,

00:03:05.840 --> 00:03:06.970
I still talk to them.

00:03:07.130 --> 00:03:08.400
They all say I'm a chatterbox.

00:03:08.400 --> 00:03:09.080
Do you think I'm a chatterbox?

00:03:09.080 --> 00:03:10.060
I don't think I'm a chatterbox at all.

00:03:10.060 --> 00:03:11.510
Don't mind my blabbering.

00:03:11.510 --> 00:03:12.540
I don't mind.

00:03:13.220 --> 00:03:14.820
I love listening to you talk.

00:03:15.140 --> 00:03:16.600
Tell me more about yourself.

00:03:16.600 --> 00:03:17.420
Sure.

00:03:17.450 --> 00:03:18.190
Let me tell you.

00:03:18.190 --> 00:03:20.370
I've been on the streets since I was 10.

00:03:25.370 --> 00:03:30.280
[Episode 7]

00:03:30.680 --> 00:03:30.810
Rest assured.

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:31.370
[Yingpute Shopping]

00:03:31.370 --> 00:03:33.079
I've bought it for you.

00:03:33.300 --> 00:03:34.500
I'm heading back now.

00:03:35.840 --> 00:03:37.590
Didn't you send me a picture?

00:03:37.620 --> 00:03:39.150
I showed it to the clerk.

00:03:39.910 --> 00:03:42.340
I might not know, but they do, right?

00:03:43.260 --> 00:03:45.590
If I got it wrong,
I'll buy you another one.

00:03:45.710 --> 00:03:46.570
How about that?

00:03:48.630 --> 00:03:49.440
Dad.

00:03:49.570 --> 00:03:50.640
-Dad?
-Don't move.

00:03:50.860 --> 00:03:52.170
If you resist,

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:53.970
I'll shoot you.

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:56.430
Dad, can you drive faster?

00:03:56.460 --> 00:03:57.460
Hang up the phone.

00:03:59.560 --> 00:04:00.360
Bro.

00:04:00.860 --> 00:04:02.470
Let's both calm down.

00:04:02.490 --> 00:04:03.410
Just tell me what you want.

00:04:03.410 --> 00:04:04.900
I-I'll give you anything.

00:04:04.930 --> 00:04:06.840
Why did you call the police earlier today?

00:04:06.840 --> 00:04:07.720
Bro,

00:04:08.210 --> 00:04:09.600
I just had a feeling

00:04:09.620 --> 00:04:11.080
you weren't a real cop,

00:04:11.080 --> 00:04:12.900
so I called the police station

00:04:12.900 --> 00:04:14.090
to verify.

00:04:14.190 --> 00:04:15.750
The police insisted on
coming over to check.

00:04:15.750 --> 00:04:17.399
How do I not look like a cop?

00:04:17.600 --> 00:04:20.040
Bro, a real cop

00:04:20.100 --> 00:04:22.079
wouldn't have a beard this long.

00:04:22.100 --> 00:04:23.110
And

00:04:23.420 --> 00:04:25.070
that photo you showed me—

00:04:25.300 --> 00:04:26.890
it's not Song Laifu.

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:28.880
The police wouldn't carry around
a fake photo, right?

00:04:28.880 --> 00:04:31.280
So I thought you were here
to cause trouble.

00:04:31.770 --> 00:04:32.870
What did you say?

00:04:34.770 --> 00:04:36.190
That's not Song Laifu?

00:04:37.390 --> 00:04:38.630
Are you sure you saw it clearly?

00:04:38.630 --> 00:04:39.890
I saw it clearly, bro.

00:04:39.890 --> 00:04:40.650
Well,

00:04:40.670 --> 00:04:42.670
that person does look
a bit like Song Laifu,

00:04:42.670 --> 00:04:44.000
but it really isn't him.

00:04:49.880 --> 00:04:53.220
Are you sure the Song Laifu you know

00:04:54.110 --> 00:04:55.690
isn't the guy in the photo?

00:04:55.720 --> 00:04:56.390
I'm sure.

00:04:56.409 --> 00:04:57.600
Bro, I'm sure.

00:04:59.960 --> 00:05:00.930
Bro.

00:05:01.160 --> 00:05:02.420
This is all just a misunderstanding.

00:05:02.420 --> 00:05:02.580
The deceased, Hu Xiaofei.

00:05:02.580 --> 00:05:03.660
[Personal Information of the Deceased]
[Name: Hu Xiaofei]

00:05:03.660 --> 00:05:04.890
Male, 28 years old.

00:05:04.890 --> 00:05:05.120
[Crime Scene Photos]

00:05:05.120 --> 00:05:06.770
The body was severely decomposed,

00:05:06.770 --> 00:05:08.360
and the estimated time of death

00:05:08.360 --> 00:05:10.370
was approximately 16 to 12 days ago,

00:05:10.370 --> 00:05:10.440
close to the time of Song Laifu's death.

00:05:10.440 --> 00:05:12.730
[Crime Scene Photos]

00:05:12.830 --> 00:05:13.950
It was a homicide.

00:05:14.300 --> 00:05:16.070
The warehouse where Hu Xiaofei lived

00:05:16.070 --> 00:05:18.180
has been confirmed as
the primary crime scene.

00:05:18.180 --> 00:05:19.950
There were signs of a struggle
in the room,

00:05:19.950 --> 00:05:23.170
and we found Song Laifu's hair
and shoeprints there.

00:05:24.250 --> 00:05:25.270
After examination,

00:05:25.270 --> 00:05:27.690
the blood found on the tip of
Song Laifu's wooden stick

00:05:27.690 --> 00:05:28.950
was confirmed to belong to Hu Xiaofei.

00:05:28.950 --> 00:05:29.750
We can establish

00:05:29.750 --> 00:05:31.750
that Hu Xiaofei was one of the fugitives

00:05:31.750 --> 00:05:33.390
wanted in the 3/12 Case.

00:05:35.950 --> 00:05:37.040
So Song Laifu had a confrontation

00:05:37.040 --> 00:05:38.900
with Hu Xiaofei before his death?

00:05:38.930 --> 00:05:40.000
Then is it possible

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:41.510
that Song Laifu was also
one of the suspects

00:05:41.510 --> 00:05:42.510
in the 3/12 Case?

00:05:42.510 --> 00:05:43.770
It's very likely.

00:05:43.890 --> 00:05:45.620
Song Laifu and Hu Xiaofei

00:05:45.620 --> 00:05:47.159
were more than 20 years apart in age,

00:05:47.159 --> 00:05:49.420
and there was no apparent overlap
in their lives.

00:05:49.420 --> 00:05:50.230
After verifying the details,

00:05:50.230 --> 00:05:50.400
[Song Laifu's Death Scene]

00:05:50.430 --> 00:05:50.659
[The Computer in Hu Xiaofei's Room]

00:05:50.659 --> 00:05:50.750
we found that the printed copy of "Abyss"
that Song Laifu had been reading

00:05:50.750 --> 00:05:51.110
[The Novel "Abyss"
in Hu Xiaofei's Computer]

00:05:53.440 --> 00:05:55.070
was sent to him by Hu Xiaofei.

00:05:55.070 --> 00:05:56.600
Yes, that's him!

00:05:56.600 --> 00:05:57.470
And that's the dog!

00:05:57.470 --> 00:05:59.990
If Song Laifu had nothing to do
with the case,

00:06:00.020 --> 00:06:02.420
why would Hu Xiaofei have sent him
the book?

00:06:02.440 --> 00:06:04.170
Judging from the novel's plot,

00:06:04.180 --> 00:06:05.270
the young protagonist

00:06:05.270 --> 00:06:08.740
is coerced into committing crimes
by 2 adult criminals.

00:06:08.950 --> 00:06:10.070
The characters' ages

00:06:10.070 --> 00:06:12.500
also correspond to the ages of
Song Laifu and Hu Xiaofei

00:06:12.500 --> 00:06:14.600
8 years ago.

00:06:14.620 --> 00:06:16.100
But all of this is still speculation.

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:17.080
[Case Report]

00:06:17.080 --> 00:06:19.030
Chief Tu, there is no conclusive
physical evidence for this.

00:06:19.030 --> 00:06:19.360
[Case Report]

00:06:19.360 --> 00:06:20.190
If

00:06:20.190 --> 00:06:20.950
Song Laifu

00:06:20.950 --> 00:06:23.620
really was a suspect in the 3/12 Case,

00:06:23.720 --> 00:06:25.740
then why was he so meticulous
and left no loopholes

00:06:25.740 --> 00:06:26.870
all those years ago,

00:06:26.890 --> 00:06:29.350
only to start leaving so many loose ends
now?

00:06:31.510 --> 00:06:32.040
There's one more thing.

00:06:32.040 --> 00:06:34.060
We checked Hu Xiaofei's computer

00:06:34.060 --> 00:06:36.060
and found a manuscript of the novel.

00:06:36.370 --> 00:06:37.659
Judging from its content

00:06:37.659 --> 00:06:38.340
and the dates of the revisions,

00:06:38.340 --> 00:06:39.360
["Abyss" Chapters]

00:06:39.420 --> 00:06:41.680
Hu Xiaofei was the author of "Abyss",

00:06:41.680 --> 00:06:43.190
not someone who had simply
downloaded and read it.

00:06:43.190 --> 00:06:43.980
It's highly likely that

00:06:43.980 --> 00:06:46.580
he adapted the story
from his own experiences.

00:06:46.770 --> 00:06:48.630
But the motive for writing a novel

00:06:48.630 --> 00:06:50.330
based on his own criminal history
and posting it online

00:06:50.330 --> 00:06:52.870
is pretty hard to understand.

00:06:59.430 --> 00:07:01.240
I remember you reported that

00:07:01.330 --> 00:07:02.910
the author of "Abyss"

00:07:03.040 --> 00:07:04.820
was Han Pinmu, a family member
of one of the victims

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:06.020
in the case back then.

00:07:06.660 --> 00:07:08.510
How did it suddenly become Hu Xiaofei?

00:07:08.510 --> 00:07:10.930
We traced the IP address and confirmed

00:07:10.960 --> 00:07:13.360
that the person
who uploaded the novel online,

00:07:13.360 --> 00:07:14.980
as well as the owner of

00:07:14.980 --> 00:07:16.790
the online author account "Han Sheng",

00:07:16.790 --> 00:07:18.460
was indeed Han Pinmu.

00:07:18.890 --> 00:07:20.170
Han Pinmu...

00:07:20.220 --> 00:07:20.680
[Dingdian Novel Website] [Abyss]

00:07:20.680 --> 00:07:21.270
[Novel Website "Abyss" Author: Han Sheng]

00:07:21.270 --> 00:07:22.770
So did he and Hu Xiaofei
have any connection?

00:07:22.770 --> 00:07:23.890
They were junior high school classmates.

00:07:23.890 --> 00:07:26.780
They grew up together and have known
each other since they were kids.

00:07:26.780 --> 00:07:28.460
What about that worker
at the paint factory?

00:07:28.460 --> 00:07:29.360
Is there anything suspicious about him?

00:07:29.360 --> 00:07:30.970
We questioned him right away.

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:33.140
He'd lived here for over 3 years.

00:07:33.470 --> 00:07:35.110
He hardly ever went out.

00:07:35.130 --> 00:07:37.340
And when he did go out, he never told me.

00:07:37.370 --> 00:07:39.040
There are 4 gates to the factory grounds,

00:07:39.040 --> 00:07:40.830
and there are plenty of ways
to get in and out.

00:07:40.830 --> 00:07:41.130
How was I supposed to know he was dead?

00:07:41.130 --> 00:07:42.800
[Filming]

00:07:43.680 --> 00:07:45.440
Hu Xiaofei wasn't a fugitive, was he?

00:07:45.440 --> 00:07:47.430
You won't charge me with harboring
a fugitive or something, will you?

00:07:47.430 --> 00:07:48.860
I'm truly innocent.

00:07:48.880 --> 00:07:50.220
I really don't know anything.

00:07:50.220 --> 00:07:51.590
I've never even seen the person

00:07:51.590 --> 00:07:53.170
you're talking about.

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:55.600
He can pretty much be ruled out
as a suspect.

00:07:56.840 --> 00:07:57.920
Hu Xiaofei's parents

00:07:57.920 --> 00:07:59.460
divorced 7 years ago,

00:07:59.490 --> 00:08:00.840
and neither of them lives locally.

00:08:00.840 --> 00:08:02.840
His mother, Qiu Yufen,
is on her way back now,

00:08:02.840 --> 00:08:04.900
but she won't arrive until tomorrow.

00:08:05.020 --> 00:08:07.230
Chief Tu, let me summarize.

00:08:07.860 --> 00:08:09.390
Based on the evidence we have so far,

00:08:09.390 --> 00:08:10.370
I think

00:08:10.390 --> 00:08:12.200
there are 4 possibilities.

00:08:12.570 --> 00:08:13.250
The first

00:08:13.870 --> 00:08:17.190
is that after Hu Xiaofei and Song Laifu
got into a fight,

00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:20.600
Song Laifu killed Hu Xiaofei,

00:08:20.900 --> 00:08:24.070
and then, on his way back to the hotel,

00:08:24.090 --> 00:08:27.180
Song Laifu was killed by another suspect.

00:08:27.390 --> 00:08:29.120
That's the first possibility.

00:08:29.570 --> 00:08:30.650
The second

00:08:31.560 --> 00:08:34.700
is that after the fight,

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:36.169
Hu Xiaofei wasn't dead.

00:08:36.490 --> 00:08:37.760
He was angry and refused to let it go.

00:08:37.760 --> 00:08:40.130
So after Song Laifu
left the paint factory,

00:08:40.130 --> 00:08:42.840
Hu Xiaofei caught up with him
and stabbed him to death.

00:08:42.840 --> 00:08:45.070
Then Hu Xiaofei returned to his place

00:08:45.100 --> 00:08:47.270
and was killed by someone else.

00:08:47.570 --> 00:08:49.670
That's the second possibility.

00:08:50.010 --> 00:08:51.560
The third possibility is that

00:08:51.560 --> 00:08:54.630
after Hu Xiaofei and Song Laifu
got into a fight,

00:08:54.650 --> 00:08:57.090
they were killed by 2 different suspects.

00:08:57.110 --> 00:08:58.710
Then there's the fourth one,

00:08:58.870 --> 00:09:01.890
which is after Hu Xiaofei and Song Laifu
had that fight,

00:09:01.890 --> 00:09:04.450
they were killed by the same suspect.

00:09:04.470 --> 00:09:06.200
Those are the 4 possibilities.

00:09:14.770 --> 00:09:17.200
So basically, there's still
another suspect out there

00:09:17.200 --> 00:09:18.860
that we haven't found, right?

00:09:19.270 --> 00:09:21.200
Why do you have to make it sound
so complicated?

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:22.740
Naming it one, two, three, four.

00:09:22.740 --> 00:09:23.670
What about five, six, seven, and eight?

00:09:23.670 --> 00:09:25.120
It's called logic, Zhao.

00:09:25.440 --> 00:09:26.700
Logic.

00:09:27.350 --> 00:09:30.460
For someone like you who can polish off
4 bowls of rice in one sitting,

00:09:30.460 --> 00:09:31.320
I guess it's a little hard to understand.

00:09:31.320 --> 00:09:32.740
Hard to understand, you know?

00:09:32.740 --> 00:09:34.390
What's wrong with me eating a lot?

00:09:34.390 --> 00:09:35.650
Being able to eat is a blessing.

00:09:35.650 --> 00:09:36.790
You'll know when you're the one hurting,
alright?

00:09:36.790 --> 00:09:38.150
Let's assume

00:09:38.150 --> 00:09:40.410
Song Laifu was a suspect in the 3/12 Case.

00:09:41.370 --> 00:09:42.780
But according to the records,

00:09:42.780 --> 00:09:45.620
he was working in Xidu during the time
the crimes were committed.

00:09:45.620 --> 00:09:46.740
How do we explain that?

00:09:46.740 --> 00:09:48.480
He could've snuck back on his own
during his vacation.

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:49.440
Five separate crimes,

00:09:49.440 --> 00:09:51.770
and he traveled back and forth every time?

00:09:51.780 --> 00:09:53.040
is that even possible?

00:10:01.400 --> 00:10:02.460
I can explain that.

00:10:05.130 --> 00:10:08.300
According to the latest information
from a source in the know,

00:10:08.300 --> 00:10:11.140
the Song Laifu we've been looking at

00:10:11.410 --> 00:10:13.760
isn't the real Song Laifu at all.

00:10:15.890 --> 00:10:17.850
His identity is fake.

00:10:18.480 --> 00:10:20.810
I recommend verifying this immediately.

00:10:28.280 --> 00:10:29.140
Take your time.

00:10:29.150 --> 00:10:31.080
Look carefully and take your time.

00:10:35.080 --> 00:10:37.630
It was too dark then,

00:10:38.170 --> 00:10:40.250
and they were all wearing masks.

00:10:40.960 --> 00:10:42.460
I already said

00:10:42.490 --> 00:10:45.090
that I didn't see their faces clearly.

00:10:47.670 --> 00:10:49.320
This guy looks so young.

00:10:49.340 --> 00:10:52.600
He must have been a child 8 years ago.

00:10:53.460 --> 00:10:54.220
Even 8 years ago,

00:10:54.220 --> 00:10:56.010
he was already an adult.

00:10:57.880 --> 00:10:59.480
If we had an audio recording,

00:10:59.570 --> 00:11:01.300
could you recognize the voice?

00:11:02.500 --> 00:11:04.100
It was too chaotic back then.

00:11:05.140 --> 00:11:07.140
And it's been so many years.

00:11:07.320 --> 00:11:08.810
I don't think I could recognize it
anymore.

00:11:08.810 --> 00:11:10.670
You told Xin Jiran before

00:11:10.690 --> 00:11:13.360
that Song Laifu looked like
one of the 3 suspects.

00:11:13.360 --> 00:11:15.950
Didn't you say you didn't see their faces?

00:11:15.970 --> 00:11:18.430
Then why did you later say
you were mistaken?

00:11:20.190 --> 00:11:23.730
One day, I heard Song Laifu
cursing at someone.

00:11:24.350 --> 00:11:26.020
He was using some really nasty language.

00:11:26.020 --> 00:11:28.140
And I remembered that the leader
of that group

00:11:28.140 --> 00:11:30.740
seemed to have used the exact same words.

00:11:30.770 --> 00:11:33.010
But I wasn't completely sure,

00:11:33.540 --> 00:11:36.800
so I told Captain Xin.

00:11:37.080 --> 00:11:39.730
I figured since he wasn't a cop anymore,

00:11:39.750 --> 00:11:42.520
even if I was mistaken,

00:11:42.690 --> 00:11:45.070
it wouldn't cause the government
any trouble.

00:11:45.070 --> 00:11:45.980
But I never expected him

00:11:45.980 --> 00:11:48.820
to keep coming back to see me after that.

00:11:49.470 --> 00:11:51.520
People started gossiping

00:11:51.620 --> 00:11:53.610
that there was something going on
between us.

00:11:53.610 --> 00:11:55.870
I didn't want to get myself into trouble,

00:11:56.040 --> 00:11:58.500
so that's why I said
I must've been mistaken.

00:12:00.740 --> 00:12:02.490
Xin Jiran was eager to solve the case

00:12:02.490 --> 00:12:03.730
and pushed too hard.

00:12:03.770 --> 00:12:05.570
I apologize to you on his behalf.

00:12:06.620 --> 00:12:07.600
You're a victim,

00:12:07.650 --> 00:12:09.150
not a suspect.

00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:14.020
You can come to me anytime
if you think of anything.

00:12:14.130 --> 00:12:16.030
As for whether the clues
are true or false,

00:12:16.030 --> 00:12:17.440
useful or not,

00:12:17.670 --> 00:12:19.230
we will make our own judgment.

00:12:19.230 --> 00:12:21.030
You don't need to worry too much.

00:12:25.530 --> 00:12:26.840
Self-drawn! I won!

00:12:26.930 --> 00:12:28.500
-Look at that.
-Money! Give me money! Come on!

00:12:28.500 --> 00:12:30.150
-Come on. Give me money! Come on!
-Look at that.

00:12:30.150 --> 00:12:30.930
Come on...

00:12:47.440 --> 00:12:48.630
Having fun, huh?

00:12:52.530 --> 00:12:53.890
Just playing mahjong for a bit.

00:12:53.890 --> 00:12:55.480
I wasn't even planning to bust anyone
for gambling today.

00:12:55.480 --> 00:12:56.890
Why are you all so nervous
when you see me?

00:12:56.890 --> 00:12:57.890
-Well...
-It's not like that. It's just…

00:12:57.890 --> 00:12:58.630
Alright, alright.

00:12:58.630 --> 00:12:59.910
Go squat in that corner
with your hands on your heads.

00:12:59.910 --> 00:13:00.360
Go on.

00:13:00.630 --> 00:13:02.890
Come on, cooperate. Hands on your heads.

00:13:03.600 --> 00:13:05.150
Song Jindi, come out with me.

00:13:05.150 --> 00:13:06.950
I have something else to ask you.

00:13:07.720 --> 00:13:08.700
Officer,

00:13:08.700 --> 00:13:10.250
w-we were just playing a little mahjong
for a few bucks.

00:13:10.250 --> 00:13:12.510
That doesn't count as gambling, does it?

00:13:26.870 --> 00:13:27.860
Song Jindi,

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:29.730
come take a look.

00:13:29.890 --> 00:13:32.220
Is this your younger brother, Song Laifu?

00:13:33.260 --> 00:13:34.020
Yes.

00:13:34.040 --> 00:13:36.420
Did you even look before saying yes?

00:13:37.890 --> 00:13:39.090
Look more carefully.

00:13:53.130 --> 00:13:54.140
It is him.

00:13:57.490 --> 00:13:58.560
Song Jindi,

00:13:59.550 --> 00:14:01.080
do you think

00:14:01.160 --> 00:14:03.010
you're the only one we can ask

00:14:03.030 --> 00:14:04.440
to verify his identity?

00:14:07.650 --> 00:14:08.390
Call him in.

00:14:08.390 --> 00:14:09.010
Okay.

00:14:10.240 --> 00:14:11.010
Mr. Tian.

00:14:13.750 --> 00:14:14.480
Mr. Tian.

00:14:15.090 --> 00:14:16.960
You've worked at
the Longxian local police station

00:14:16.960 --> 00:14:18.200
for 40 years.

00:14:18.220 --> 00:14:19.370
Could you take a look

00:14:19.400 --> 00:14:21.930
and see if this is Song Laifu
from Gao Village?

00:14:28.940 --> 00:14:31.110
This person looks somewhat similar to him,

00:14:31.110 --> 00:14:32.570
but I don't think it's him.

00:14:33.370 --> 00:14:34.900
What else do you have to say?

00:14:35.530 --> 00:14:36.330
I...

00:14:36.610 --> 00:14:39.280
How could I not recognize my own brother?

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:41.060
He... He's too old.

00:14:41.080 --> 00:14:42.080
He probably didn't see clearly.

00:14:42.080 --> 00:14:43.910
Song Jindi, I'm warning you.

00:14:43.910 --> 00:14:46.460
This guy lying right in front of you

00:14:46.490 --> 00:14:48.890
is a wanted criminal
suspected of committing 7 murders

00:14:48.890 --> 00:14:50.780
and evading capture for 8 years.

00:14:50.810 --> 00:14:52.070
If you lie,

00:14:52.090 --> 00:14:53.730
once we find out the truth,

00:14:53.760 --> 00:14:56.850
you'll be an accomplice who helped him
conceal his identity.

00:14:56.850 --> 00:14:58.310
I've warned you.

00:15:00.760 --> 00:15:02.190
I remember

00:15:02.520 --> 00:15:05.520
that when Song Laifu was young,
he got into a violent fight

00:15:05.520 --> 00:15:07.860
and was stabbed in the gallbladder.

00:15:07.890 --> 00:15:09.750
They had to remove his entire gallbladder.

00:15:09.750 --> 00:15:11.350
We can check and verify that.

00:15:11.350 --> 00:15:13.060
Okay. Go get Luo.

00:15:13.080 --> 00:15:14.270
Officer!

00:15:14.300 --> 00:15:16.750
I... I was forced!

00:15:16.900 --> 00:15:19.440
They said if I told anyone,

00:15:19.740 --> 00:15:21.740
they'd kill my entire family!

00:15:21.760 --> 00:15:22.810
Who are they?

00:15:24.490 --> 00:15:27.890
It was back in 2004... or 2005,

00:15:27.920 --> 00:15:28.110
Laifu called and said

00:15:28.110 --> 00:15:29.910
[Filming]

00:15:29.910 --> 00:15:32.310
he was coming back
for the Spring Festival.

00:15:32.470 --> 00:15:35.430
My brother had been working
away from home since he was young,

00:15:35.430 --> 00:15:37.080
and he rarely came back to the village.

00:15:37.080 --> 00:15:38.250
I figured

00:15:38.440 --> 00:15:40.980
he must've hit a rough patch
and was coming back

00:15:40.980 --> 00:15:42.710
to borrow some money from me.

00:15:42.740 --> 00:15:43.830
But in the end,

00:15:45.910 --> 00:15:48.310
he never came home
for the Spring Festival.

00:15:48.360 --> 00:15:50.120
That guy came instead.

00:15:50.790 --> 00:15:51.740
As soon as he arrived, he told me

00:15:51.740 --> 00:15:52.870
to pack up all of Laifu's stuff

00:15:52.870 --> 00:15:54.600
and hand it over to him,

00:15:54.620 --> 00:15:56.040
and that from then on,

00:15:56.160 --> 00:15:57.640
he would be Song Laifu.

00:15:58.200 --> 00:16:00.290
Then he threatened

00:16:01.200 --> 00:16:02.800
to kill my whole family

00:16:03.550 --> 00:16:05.050
if I ever told anyone.

00:16:05.300 --> 00:16:08.710
He said he wouldn't stay in the village.

00:16:08.750 --> 00:16:09.650
He kind of looked like

00:16:09.650 --> 00:16:11.320
my brother,

00:16:11.590 --> 00:16:13.700
and the villagers hadn't seen my brother
in years.

00:16:13.700 --> 00:16:15.240
I... I thought

00:16:15.240 --> 00:16:16.650
maybe no one would notice,

00:16:16.650 --> 00:16:18.240
so... so I...

00:16:18.590 --> 00:16:20.160
I agreed to it.

00:16:20.250 --> 00:16:22.530
He didn't tell you
where your brother went?

00:16:22.530 --> 00:16:23.660
No.

00:16:24.560 --> 00:16:26.960
From the way he talked,
I got the impression

00:16:27.500 --> 00:16:29.170
that he'd killed him.

00:16:29.470 --> 00:16:31.140
He killed your brother,

00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:32.800
and you still helped him?

00:16:32.800 --> 00:16:34.700
He gave me 10,000 yuan.

00:16:34.730 --> 00:16:36.140
Was it 10,000 yuan?

00:16:39.670 --> 00:16:41.440
I-It was 20,000.

00:16:43.420 --> 00:16:44.150
I... I...

00:16:44.150 --> 00:16:46.420
My brother and I were never that close
growing up.

00:16:46.420 --> 00:16:47.600
We were just okay.

00:16:47.630 --> 00:16:49.000
But he was my brother after all.

00:16:49.000 --> 00:16:50.150
My own brother, right?

00:16:50.150 --> 00:16:50.940
And he never got married.

00:16:50.940 --> 00:16:51.940
If he died out there,

00:16:51.940 --> 00:16:53.130
then that money

00:16:53.130 --> 00:16:54.720
was basically compensation for the family,
right?

00:16:54.720 --> 00:16:55.650
So I... I just took

00:16:55.650 --> 00:16:57.110
what was rightfully mine.

00:16:58.730 --> 00:17:00.900
That's complete nonsense.

00:17:01.030 --> 00:17:02.790
He killed your brother,

00:17:02.820 --> 00:17:04.680
and instead of calling the police,

00:17:04.680 --> 00:17:06.540
you helped him hide his identity.

00:17:06.740 --> 00:17:09.200
Do you realize that makes you
an accomplice?

00:17:09.270 --> 00:17:10.660
How was I supposed to know that?

00:17:10.660 --> 00:17:11.980
I... I...

00:17:11.980 --> 00:17:13.829
And besides, I... I was scared.

00:17:13.829 --> 00:17:14.740
It's not that you didn't know.

00:17:14.740 --> 00:17:16.569
It's that you're only after the money.

00:17:16.569 --> 00:17:18.609
Now that that fake Song Laifu is dead,

00:17:18.609 --> 00:17:20.670
who else could pose a threat to you?

00:17:20.740 --> 00:17:22.010
Why didn't you say anything

00:17:22.010 --> 00:17:23.290
when you were asked to identify the body?

00:17:23.290 --> 00:17:24.900
You were just after the compensation

00:17:24.900 --> 00:17:27.250
from Huangzhiyuan Hotel, weren't you?

00:17:27.339 --> 00:17:29.800
You led the villagers here
to cause trouble—

00:17:29.850 --> 00:17:31.850
you think we didn't know about that?

00:17:33.270 --> 00:17:35.160
How many accomplices
did that fake Song Laifu have?

00:17:35.160 --> 00:17:35.990
No idea.

00:17:37.250 --> 00:17:39.180
Anyway, he was the only one who came in

00:17:39.180 --> 00:17:40.240
to talk to me at the time.

00:17:40.240 --> 00:17:42.240
Then why did you say "they"?

00:17:42.330 --> 00:17:43.530
Well, when I was packing up,

00:17:43.530 --> 00:17:44.790
someone outside called out to him,

00:17:44.790 --> 00:17:46.180
telling him to hurry up.

00:17:46.350 --> 00:17:47.610
So you must at least

00:17:47.610 --> 00:17:48.680
know his real name, right?

00:17:48.680 --> 00:17:50.220
How would I know that?

00:17:53.660 --> 00:17:55.190
Oh, right.

00:17:55.880 --> 00:17:57.510
The guy who called out to him—

00:17:58.380 --> 00:18:00.110
I think he called him "Mr. San."

00:18:10.060 --> 00:18:14.640
[Mr. San]

00:18:15.060 --> 00:18:17.560
Li Yaoming and his wife, Li Fang;

00:18:17.680 --> 00:18:20.210
mother and daughter
Zhang Lina and Wang Ping;

00:18:20.570 --> 00:18:21.770
chemical plant worker Liu Xiaohua;

00:18:21.770 --> 00:18:22.350
[Zhang Lina, Wang Ping, Liu Xiaohua]

00:18:22.370 --> 00:18:23.170
[Du Juan, Bi Dehua, Hu Xiaofei]

00:18:23.220 --> 00:18:25.150
technical school teacher Du Juan;

00:18:25.480 --> 00:18:28.440
suspects Bi Dehua and Hu Xiaofei;

00:18:28.510 --> 00:18:30.420
the so-called "Mr. San"
who was posing as Song Laifu;

00:18:30.420 --> 00:18:31.420
[Song Laifu] [Nickname: Mr. San]

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:31.630
[Song Jindi] [Confession]

00:18:31.630 --> 00:18:34.760
and the real Song Laifu,
whose whereabouts are unknown.

00:18:35.030 --> 00:18:35.850
That makes 10.

00:18:36.480 --> 00:18:38.480
Add Chen Chunli,
who happened to survive

00:18:38.480 --> 00:18:40.340
and we've got a whole soccer team.

00:18:41.610 --> 00:18:43.550
You still have time to joke around?

00:18:43.720 --> 00:18:45.850
Listen, everyone, this case
is getting deeper and deeper.

00:18:45.850 --> 00:18:46.830
If we can't crack it soon,

00:18:46.830 --> 00:18:47.830
the people coming here next

00:18:47.830 --> 00:18:49.140
won't just be the provincial
Public Security Department task force.

00:18:49.140 --> 00:18:51.250
It'll be the Ministry of Public Security.

00:18:51.250 --> 00:18:53.090
Getting to make an appearance
in front of the higher-ups—

00:18:53.090 --> 00:18:54.790
isn't that exactly what you want?

00:18:54.790 --> 00:18:56.070
When you get promoted,

00:18:56.070 --> 00:18:57.000
don't forget to treat us to a meal.

00:18:57.000 --> 00:18:58.290
You call that "making an appearance"?

00:18:58.290 --> 00:18:59.600
This could just as easily end with
me getting my ass handed to me.

00:18:59.600 --> 00:19:02.530
And when that happens,
I'm dragging you down with me.

00:19:03.880 --> 00:19:05.240
Based on what we know so far,

00:19:05.240 --> 00:19:06.790
we believe the 3/12 Case from 8 years ago

00:19:06.790 --> 00:19:08.940
is strongly connected to

00:19:09.010 --> 00:19:10.230
the 2 recent murders.

00:19:10.230 --> 00:19:11.340
[Hu Xiaofei, Author of "Abyss"]

00:19:11.340 --> 00:19:11.480
Bi Dehua and Hu Xiaofei

00:19:11.480 --> 00:19:12.520
[Li Yaoming, Li Fang,
Zhang Lina, Wang Ping, Liu Xiaohua]

00:19:12.550 --> 00:19:12.910
[Du Juan, Bi Dehua, Hu Xiaofei]

00:19:12.910 --> 00:19:15.340
were likely suspects in the 3/12 Case.

00:19:15.370 --> 00:19:17.640
With 3 suspects killed one after another,

00:19:17.640 --> 00:19:19.090
there are 2 possibilities:

00:19:19.090 --> 00:19:21.160
first, the victims' families
are seeking revenge.

00:19:21.160 --> 00:19:23.370
Second, the suspects in the 3/12 Case
turned on each other

00:19:23.370 --> 00:19:25.230
and started killing one another.

00:19:25.330 --> 00:19:26.380
Either way,

00:19:26.380 --> 00:19:28.150
the person we're most suspicious of is...

00:19:28.150 --> 00:19:29.240
[Han Pinmu]

00:19:30.600 --> 00:19:31.420
[Han Pinmu]

00:19:31.420 --> 00:19:32.210
Han Pinmu.

00:19:37.870 --> 00:19:39.870
[Han Pinmu]

00:19:40.150 --> 00:19:43.030
Du Juan was Han Pinmu's stepmother.

00:19:43.220 --> 00:19:44.510
According to the case files,

00:19:44.510 --> 00:19:46.520
the two of them had
an extremely strained relationship.

00:19:46.520 --> 00:19:48.120
We suspected Han Pinmu before,

00:19:48.120 --> 00:19:50.850
but we could never find any evidence
to back it up.

00:19:51.200 --> 00:19:53.460
But this doesn't feel like revenge to me.

00:19:54.700 --> 00:19:57.360
I'm leaning toward
the second possibility too.

00:19:57.450 --> 00:19:59.920
Han Pinmu was involved in the 3/12 Case.

00:20:00.030 --> 00:20:02.290
And his motive for working on that novel
with Hu Xiaofei

00:20:02.290 --> 00:20:03.750
is highly suspicious.

00:20:03.770 --> 00:20:06.680
Also, Li Cheng once saw a photo
in Han Pinmu's room

00:20:06.740 --> 00:20:09.240
that had been torn in half.

00:20:09.240 --> 00:20:10.680
We can now confirm that

00:20:10.680 --> 00:20:13.530
it was a two shot of Han Pinmu
and Hu Xiaofei.

00:20:13.610 --> 00:20:15.270
It's very likely the same photo

00:20:15.270 --> 00:20:17.400
as the one of Bi Dehua that was found

00:20:18.000 --> 00:20:19.790
at Hu Xiaofei's murder scene.

00:20:19.790 --> 00:20:20.720
Wait a minute.

00:20:26.380 --> 00:20:29.520
How could Li Cheng have been
in Han Pinmu's room?

00:20:34.080 --> 00:20:38.690
Well, Li Cheng is a regular
at Han Pinmu's internet cafe.

00:20:38.720 --> 00:20:40.380
He's Han Pinmu's friend

00:20:40.380 --> 00:20:43.250
and a member of Han Pinmu's gaming group.

00:20:43.500 --> 00:20:44.440
Moreover,

00:20:44.640 --> 00:20:46.510
Li Cheng also once played games online

00:20:46.510 --> 00:20:48.380
with Hu Xiaofei.

00:20:48.380 --> 00:20:49.780
What a coincidence, huh?

00:20:50.640 --> 00:20:51.600
Zhao Ganzhe.

00:20:52.200 --> 00:20:53.640
Isn't that too much of a coincidence?

00:20:53.640 --> 00:20:55.790
No, this is no coincidence at all.

00:20:57.030 --> 00:20:58.140
You and Xin Jiran

00:20:58.140 --> 00:21:00.420
never gave up on the 3/12 Case.

00:21:00.490 --> 00:21:02.350
You've long suspected Han Pinmu,

00:21:02.400 --> 00:21:04.310
so you sent a new recruit who hadn't
even officially joined the force yet

00:21:04.310 --> 00:21:05.480
to go undercover at the internet cafe

00:21:05.480 --> 00:21:07.030
and investigate Han Pinmu on his own.

00:21:07.030 --> 00:21:07.980
Am I right?

00:21:09.550 --> 00:21:10.830
I was wondering

00:21:10.830 --> 00:21:12.140
how a rookie who hadn't
even joined the force

00:21:12.140 --> 00:21:14.110
could know so much about the case.

00:21:14.680 --> 00:21:15.550
Zhao Ganzhe.

00:21:16.110 --> 00:21:18.440
You even took him to examine crime scenes.

00:21:18.530 --> 00:21:20.000
What if something had happened to him?

00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:21.980
How were you going to answer for that?

00:21:21.980 --> 00:21:23.250
Li Cheng volunteered.

00:21:23.250 --> 00:21:24.250
He knew what he was getting into.

00:21:24.250 --> 00:21:25.850
He knew what he was getting into?

00:21:25.850 --> 00:21:27.750
So, when we questioned him at the hotel,

00:21:27.750 --> 00:21:31.050
you were putting on an act with me,
and only me, the whole time?

00:21:31.050 --> 00:21:32.010
Zhao Ganzhe,

00:21:32.130 --> 00:21:34.390
why don't you just go be an actor instead?

00:21:34.460 --> 00:21:36.520
At first, I just wanted to find a new face

00:21:36.520 --> 00:21:39.130
who knew his way around games
to test the waters.

00:21:39.130 --> 00:21:40.590
But after working with him all this time,

00:21:40.590 --> 00:21:43.570
I've seen his abilities
and his sense of responsibility firsthand.

00:21:43.570 --> 00:21:45.460
If you think I broke the rules,

00:21:45.480 --> 00:21:46.970
I'm willing to accept
whatever punishment you give me.

00:21:46.970 --> 00:21:48.250
But please, don't drag Li Cheng
into this, okay?

00:21:48.250 --> 00:21:49.230
Don't worry.

00:21:49.500 --> 00:21:51.090
You definitely won't escape punishment,

00:21:51.090 --> 00:21:52.180
but not now.

00:21:52.440 --> 00:21:53.310
Wait until this case is closed,

00:21:53.310 --> 00:21:54.850
and then you'll see what I do with you.

00:21:54.850 --> 00:21:56.290
If you think you can
walk away from this now,

00:21:56.290 --> 00:21:57.620
forget it. Not a chance.

00:21:57.640 --> 00:21:58.310
Go on.

00:21:59.380 --> 00:22:00.880
Han Pinmu, Bi Dehua, and Hu Xiaofei

00:22:00.880 --> 00:22:01.770
took a group photo together,

00:22:01.770 --> 00:22:03.850
indicating they used to be friends.

00:22:03.900 --> 00:22:06.290
Then was the third suspect back then

00:22:06.310 --> 00:22:08.900
the fake Song Laifu,

00:22:09.070 --> 00:22:10.310
or Han Pinmu?

00:22:14.880 --> 00:22:15.850
I'm young

00:22:15.850 --> 00:22:18.050
and didn't take part in the investigation
8 years ago.

00:22:18.050 --> 00:22:19.250
But I don't think the fact that

00:22:19.250 --> 00:22:21.180
there are 3 suspects
in the Chen Chunli case

00:22:21.180 --> 00:22:23.590
means there were only 3 suspects

00:22:23.590 --> 00:22:25.130
in the entire 3/12 Case, right?

00:22:25.130 --> 00:22:28.670
"Mr. San" used Song Laifu's identity
to give himself a clean slate.

00:22:28.670 --> 00:22:30.020
There's no way

00:22:30.050 --> 00:22:31.290
he's never committed a crime.

00:22:31.290 --> 00:22:32.470
Add him and Han Pinmu to the mix,

00:22:32.470 --> 00:22:34.400
and that makes 4 suspects already.

00:22:34.980 --> 00:22:36.160
I actually think

00:22:36.160 --> 00:22:38.070
we could broaden our perspective a bit—

00:22:38.070 --> 00:22:39.330
there might be more than 4 suspects.

00:22:39.330 --> 00:22:41.300
Li Cheng once proposed a theory:

00:22:41.320 --> 00:22:43.880
at first, there were 2 adult perpetrators.

00:22:43.900 --> 00:22:47.010
Because of certain
unusual motives and fixations,

00:22:47.100 --> 00:22:49.100
they later began

00:22:49.130 --> 00:22:51.090
coercing young people
into participating in their crimes.

00:22:51.090 --> 00:22:53.520
And the young accomplice was different
each time.

00:22:53.520 --> 00:22:54.780
Bi Dehua, Hu Xiaofei, and Han Pinmu

00:22:54.780 --> 00:22:55.490
[Hu Xiaofei]

00:22:55.510 --> 00:22:56.060
[Han Pinmu]

00:22:56.220 --> 00:22:58.550
could all have been coerced into
becoming accomplices.

00:22:58.550 --> 00:22:59.410
That would explain why
they kept each other's involvement secret.

00:22:59.410 --> 00:23:00.880
[Hu Xiaofei] [Han Pinmu]

00:23:01.010 --> 00:23:02.980
Later, Bi Dehua may have been killed
by the others

00:23:02.980 --> 00:23:04.330
for some unknown reason—

00:23:04.330 --> 00:23:06.590
possibly because he let something slip.

00:23:08.050 --> 00:23:09.270
That's an interesting theory.

00:23:09.270 --> 00:23:10.530
It lines up

00:23:10.530 --> 00:23:12.740
pretty well with the traces left

00:23:12.770 --> 00:23:13.970
at all 3 crime scenes,

00:23:14.730 --> 00:23:17.260
and it also matches
Chen Chunli's testimony.

00:23:19.870 --> 00:23:20.510
All right.

00:23:22.160 --> 00:23:23.520
Let me summarize.

00:23:23.540 --> 00:23:24.870
Based on the latest leads,

00:23:24.870 --> 00:23:26.480
we now have 2 main lines

00:23:26.500 --> 00:23:27.560
of investigation:

00:23:27.740 --> 00:23:30.170
the fake Song Laifu and Han Pinmu.

00:23:30.760 --> 00:23:33.090
Hu Sen, Wang Tao, Yang Feng, and Xu Ling,

00:23:33.110 --> 00:23:35.300
the 4 of you will investigate
the fake Song Laifu.

00:23:35.300 --> 00:23:36.470
We need to

00:23:36.490 --> 00:23:38.220
get to the bottom of his ID card.

00:23:38.380 --> 00:23:39.680
His current ID

00:23:39.680 --> 00:23:41.000
was issued in 2007.

00:23:41.000 --> 00:23:42.270
How did the household registration
officials process that?

00:23:42.270 --> 00:23:43.760
Was it negligence or dereliction of duty?

00:23:43.760 --> 00:23:45.360
And there's another question.
After all these years

00:23:45.360 --> 00:23:46.440
and having committed such a major crime,

00:23:46.440 --> 00:23:47.500
why hasn't he fled?

00:23:47.550 --> 00:23:48.900
Was sheer audacity the only reason,

00:23:48.900 --> 00:23:50.700
or was there something else
keeping him here?

00:23:50.700 --> 00:23:53.060
Could he have accomplices
at Huangzhiyuan Hotel?

00:23:53.060 --> 00:23:54.300
Look into every one

00:23:54.750 --> 00:23:55.980
of his coworkers

00:23:55.980 --> 00:23:56.850
from that angle—

00:23:56.850 --> 00:23:59.010
especially Zhang Chengguo,
the one who hired him,

00:23:59.010 --> 00:24:00.290
and the owner of the hotel, Li Zhengbin.

00:24:00.290 --> 00:24:00.880
Yes, sir.

00:24:00.880 --> 00:24:01.700
Yes, sir.

00:24:02.200 --> 00:24:04.600
The two of us
will go investigate Han Pinmu.

00:24:04.680 --> 00:24:06.350
I'll go get the search warrant.

00:24:06.350 --> 00:24:06.880
Yes, sir.

00:24:08.140 --> 00:24:11.040
What are we going to do with him?
Are we bringing him back?

00:24:11.040 --> 00:24:12.730
That depends on what we find.

00:24:16.960 --> 00:24:22.620
[Police]

00:24:28.630 --> 00:24:30.180
What's wrong? Gout acting up?

00:24:30.180 --> 00:24:31.610
I think I pulled my back.

00:24:33.030 --> 00:24:33.770
Are you okay?

00:24:33.800 --> 00:24:34.540
I'm fine.

00:24:35.520 --> 00:24:37.110
[Police]

00:24:44.910 --> 00:24:45.820
Police.

00:24:45.900 --> 00:24:46.960
Where's your boss?

00:24:47.270 --> 00:24:48.250
Upstairs.

00:24:50.920 --> 00:24:51.920
You two stay here.

00:24:57.850 --> 00:24:59.690
Are you both staff here?

00:25:06.230 --> 00:25:07.140
This way.

00:25:19.850 --> 00:25:20.820
Han Pinmu?

00:25:21.550 --> 00:25:22.800
Han Pinmu, open the door!

00:25:22.800 --> 00:25:23.980
Police.

00:25:24.080 --> 00:25:25.940
We need to ask you a few questions.

00:26:05.370 --> 00:26:06.990
Playing tricks.

00:26:07.570 --> 00:26:08.200
Get up!

00:26:17.360 --> 00:26:18.300
Officers.

00:26:18.330 --> 00:26:21.170
Doesn't this count as trespassing?

00:26:23.820 --> 00:26:26.070
[Huangshui Public Security Bureau]
[Search Warrant]

00:26:29.230 --> 00:26:30.910
Hello. Are you checking in?

00:26:31.200 --> 00:26:32.330
We're from the County Public Security
Bureau's Criminal Investigation Brigade.

00:26:32.330 --> 00:26:32.940
[Public Security]

00:26:32.940 --> 00:26:33.850
Is Zhang Chengguo here?

00:26:33.850 --> 00:26:35.400
Manager Zhang is off today.

00:26:35.400 --> 00:26:36.740
What about your boss, Li Zhengbin?

00:26:36.740 --> 00:26:37.810
He's in his office.

00:26:37.810 --> 00:26:39.030
I'll give him a call.

00:26:39.030 --> 00:26:41.230
No need. We'll just find him ourselves.

00:26:43.700 --> 00:26:45.830
Do you know why we came looking for you?

00:26:45.960 --> 00:26:46.720
I don't.

00:26:47.370 --> 00:26:48.790
Do you know Hu Xiaofei?

00:26:49.380 --> 00:26:51.340
Yes, he's my best friend.

00:26:51.590 --> 00:26:53.590
How often do you contact him?

00:26:54.310 --> 00:26:55.440
It depends.

00:26:55.440 --> 00:26:57.900
We send messages in the group chat
every day.

00:26:58.240 --> 00:27:00.590
But he hasn't been online
for the past few days,

00:27:00.590 --> 00:27:02.590
and I can't get through to his phone.

00:27:02.700 --> 00:27:04.300
Did something happen to him?

00:27:05.480 --> 00:27:07.680
You knew something had happened to him?

00:27:07.720 --> 00:27:09.140
With so many of you cops here

00:27:09.140 --> 00:27:10.850
asking questions about him
right off the bat,

00:27:10.850 --> 00:27:13.630
anyone with a normal IQ
would think that, wouldn't they?

00:27:13.630 --> 00:27:14.610
He's dead.

00:27:14.930 --> 00:27:15.820
Dead?

00:27:16.440 --> 00:27:17.400
How did he die?

00:27:17.430 --> 00:27:18.950
On the 15th of this month,

00:27:18.970 --> 00:27:20.430
between 10 a.m. and 2 p.m.,

00:27:20.440 --> 00:27:21.200
where were you?

00:27:21.200 --> 00:27:22.050
At home.

00:27:23.430 --> 00:27:25.090
You answered pretty quickly.

00:27:25.480 --> 00:27:27.200
You didn't even
have to think about something

00:27:27.200 --> 00:27:28.700
that happened 2 weeks ago?

00:27:29.070 --> 00:27:31.250
I lead a very regular life.

00:27:31.470 --> 00:27:33.300
Besides going for a run

00:27:33.320 --> 00:27:35.060
and occasionally having dinner
with coworkers,

00:27:35.060 --> 00:27:37.720
I spend most of my time
here at the internet cafe.

00:27:37.770 --> 00:27:39.090
The only exception was that day—

00:27:39.090 --> 00:27:40.460
it was my mom's birthday.

00:27:40.460 --> 00:27:41.850
I went home to clean up

00:27:41.880 --> 00:27:43.540
and burn some incense for her.

00:27:43.870 --> 00:27:45.870
It was raining that day.

00:27:45.890 --> 00:27:47.920
I went home around 7 in the morning

00:27:47.940 --> 00:27:51.070
and stayed there until evening
before coming back here.

00:27:51.940 --> 00:27:54.020
Can anyone verify that?

00:27:54.380 --> 00:27:55.300
No.

00:27:56.670 --> 00:27:57.940
When I went upstairs,

00:27:57.940 --> 00:28:00.050
I helped carry rice for my neighbor,
Mrs. Mo.

00:28:00.050 --> 00:28:01.860
She should be able to confirm
that I went home,

00:28:01.860 --> 00:28:03.000
but she can't prove

00:28:03.000 --> 00:28:04.660
I stayed there all day.

00:28:06.310 --> 00:28:07.610
We'll go verify

00:28:07.630 --> 00:28:09.160
everything you've told us.

00:28:10.420 --> 00:28:11.530
Have you been serializing

00:28:11.530 --> 00:28:13.050
a novel online?

00:28:13.740 --> 00:28:14.610
Be careful.

00:28:14.610 --> 00:28:15.850
Don't break my figures.

00:28:15.850 --> 00:28:17.310
They never killed anyone.

00:28:17.440 --> 00:28:19.310
They didn't, but you have?

00:28:19.570 --> 00:28:20.830
Of course not.

00:28:21.850 --> 00:28:23.860
But I do know a murderer—

00:28:23.890 --> 00:28:25.430
he died 8 years ago.

00:28:25.750 --> 00:28:27.310
You mean Bi Dehua?

00:28:27.630 --> 00:28:28.260
Yes.

00:28:29.480 --> 00:28:31.100
We questioned you

00:28:31.120 --> 00:28:32.490
back when Bi Dehua was killed.

00:28:32.490 --> 00:28:33.510
Why didn't you mention that you knew him?

00:28:33.510 --> 00:28:35.270
You two were friends?

00:28:35.350 --> 00:28:37.530
Who said we were friends?

00:28:38.030 --> 00:28:38.850
We just played basketball together

00:28:38.850 --> 00:28:40.850
at the Workers' Cultural Palace.

00:28:40.900 --> 00:28:41.850
We barely knew each other.

00:28:41.850 --> 00:28:44.830
Then what about Hu Xiaofei and Bi Dehua?
Were they friends?

00:28:44.830 --> 00:28:46.000
I don't really know anything

00:28:46.000 --> 00:28:47.530
about their relationship.

00:28:47.550 --> 00:28:49.290
Did you ever take a photo together

00:28:49.290 --> 00:28:50.890
with Hu Xiaofei and Bi Dehua?

00:28:53.000 --> 00:28:54.070
I don't think so.

00:28:54.590 --> 00:28:56.790
Even if we did,
it would've been years ago.

00:28:56.790 --> 00:28:58.320
I honestly don't remember.

00:28:58.740 --> 00:29:00.480
Why did you write this novel?

00:29:01.090 --> 00:29:04.160
Actually, it was Xiaofei who wrote it.

00:29:04.180 --> 00:29:06.430
I was just responsible for uploading it.

00:29:06.430 --> 00:29:08.920
If he wrote it, why did he have you
publish it?

00:29:09.370 --> 00:29:10.810
Since you're here asking me,

00:29:10.810 --> 00:29:12.790
I assume you've already read the novel.

00:29:12.790 --> 00:29:14.790
As for that case 8 years ago,

00:29:15.150 --> 00:29:18.090
I suppose I could be considered
a family member of one of the victims.

00:29:18.090 --> 00:29:19.540
Last year, Xiaofei told me

00:29:19.540 --> 00:29:21.790
he wanted to turn the 3/12 Case
into a novel.

00:29:21.790 --> 00:29:23.450
He said there'd definitely be people
interested in it,

00:29:23.450 --> 00:29:25.280
and maybe it could even be adapted into
a movie or TV series

00:29:25.280 --> 00:29:26.530
and make us a lot of money.

00:29:26.530 --> 00:29:27.660
He asked if I was okay with it.

00:29:27.660 --> 00:29:29.350
Of course I didn't mind.

00:29:29.590 --> 00:29:31.830
As for putting my name down
as the author,

00:29:31.830 --> 00:29:33.260
that was Xiaofei's idea too.

00:29:33.260 --> 00:29:34.250
He said publishing it

00:29:34.250 --> 00:29:36.350
under my name,
as a victim's family member,

00:29:36.350 --> 00:29:37.700
would make it easier
to generate publicity.

00:29:37.700 --> 00:29:39.660
As for the copyright and royalties,

00:29:39.660 --> 00:29:41.340
we'd split everything 50-50.

00:29:41.360 --> 00:29:42.480
I didn't have to do anything

00:29:42.480 --> 00:29:43.590
and would still get paid,

00:29:43.590 --> 00:29:44.890
so of course I agreed.

00:29:46.010 --> 00:29:46.850
Too bad.

00:29:46.960 --> 00:29:49.070
Hardly anyone even read the thing.

00:29:50.790 --> 00:29:52.870
So you two have always been on good terms?

00:29:52.870 --> 00:29:53.590
Yes.

00:29:53.940 --> 00:29:54.860
Very good.

00:29:55.870 --> 00:29:56.920
We were in the same class
in junior high,

00:29:56.920 --> 00:29:57.860
and we got in the same senior high.

00:29:57.860 --> 00:29:59.400
We even once shared a dorm.

00:30:00.140 --> 00:30:01.830
Although we haven't seen much of
each other these past few years,

00:30:01.830 --> 00:30:04.230
we've been playing games online
together all the time.

00:30:04.230 --> 00:30:05.370
These days,

00:30:05.390 --> 00:30:06.860
online friends are way more reliable

00:30:06.860 --> 00:30:08.990
than the friends you have in real life.

00:30:10.750 --> 00:30:13.150
You haven't seen each other
for 2 or 3 years.

00:30:13.650 --> 00:30:15.180
Have you been to his house?

00:30:15.940 --> 00:30:17.330
Didn't his whole family move away?

00:30:17.330 --> 00:30:18.660
He told you that?

00:30:18.720 --> 00:30:19.500
Yeah.

00:30:19.530 --> 00:30:21.260
He said he moved to Xiping.

00:30:21.450 --> 00:30:23.250
I even asked him out for dinner
during the New Year these past few years,

00:30:23.250 --> 00:30:24.980
but he said he didn't come back.

00:30:27.000 --> 00:30:28.710
The way you're asking,

00:30:28.810 --> 00:30:31.470
has he been living in Huangshui
this whole time?

00:30:36.130 --> 00:30:37.990
Let's go take a look at your place.

00:30:39.110 --> 00:30:39.750
Let's go.

00:30:54.620 --> 00:30:55.510
Wei,

00:30:55.650 --> 00:30:57.650
call Li Cheng and Fat Dog

00:30:57.680 --> 00:30:59.270
and tell them the afternoon activity
is canceled.

00:30:59.270 --> 00:31:01.200
I have to go out to run some errands.

00:31:10.490 --> 00:31:11.350
That's enough.

00:31:13.000 --> 00:31:14.180
Stop it.

00:31:14.220 --> 00:31:14.640
Get lost.

00:31:14.640 --> 00:31:15.770
Is that good enough?

00:31:18.830 --> 00:31:20.160
Mom, I need to take this.

00:31:20.950 --> 00:31:22.470
So annoying.

00:31:24.000 --> 00:31:24.640
Hello?

00:31:24.750 --> 00:31:25.750
Hello, Li Cheng.

00:31:25.750 --> 00:31:26.790
You don't have to come this afternoon.

00:31:26.790 --> 00:31:28.750
Boss said we're not playing
this afternoon.

00:31:28.750 --> 00:31:29.900
Are you closing this afternoon?

00:31:29.900 --> 00:31:30.700
No.

00:31:31.500 --> 00:31:32.430
Then I'll see.

00:31:32.430 --> 00:31:34.050
If I have time, I'll still come over
and play for a while.

00:31:34.050 --> 00:31:34.940
Suit yourself.

00:31:34.940 --> 00:31:37.030
Anyway, Boss won't be able to play.

00:31:37.440 --> 00:31:38.350
What happened to him?

00:31:38.350 --> 00:31:40.050
Some police officers came
and took him away.

00:31:40.050 --> 00:31:41.980
I don't know what happened either.

00:31:43.880 --> 00:31:45.780
Maybe they just want to
ask him some questions.

00:31:45.780 --> 00:31:47.610
Huangshui hasn't been peaceful lately.

00:31:47.610 --> 00:31:48.720
Alright.

00:31:48.720 --> 00:31:50.570
Then we'll talk when you get here.

00:31:50.570 --> 00:31:51.250
Okay.

00:31:58.790 --> 00:31:59.650
That's enough.

00:32:00.530 --> 00:32:01.500
I'm telling you,

00:32:01.500 --> 00:32:02.770
you're about to officially start your job.

00:32:02.770 --> 00:32:03.920
You need to focus.

00:32:04.010 --> 00:32:05.330
Don't get addicted to video games

00:32:05.330 --> 00:32:06.570
and let it affect your work.

00:32:06.570 --> 00:32:08.220
Mom, I won't.

00:32:08.240 --> 00:32:10.100
Don't you trust my self-control?

00:32:10.110 --> 00:32:11.280
As long as you know what you're doing,

00:32:11.280 --> 00:32:12.000
my big boy.

00:32:14.310 --> 00:32:15.090
Who is it?

00:32:15.460 --> 00:32:16.400
I'll get it.

00:32:23.330 --> 00:32:24.730
Manager Zhang?

00:32:24.790 --> 00:32:26.630
What brings you to our house?

00:32:26.660 --> 00:32:28.000
I'm here to congratulate

00:32:28.000 --> 00:32:29.570
Officer Li.

00:32:30.640 --> 00:32:31.660
Look, Mrs. Sun.

00:32:31.680 --> 00:32:33.080
Just caught from the pond.

00:32:33.080 --> 00:32:34.640
It was still jumping a moment ago.

00:32:34.640 --> 00:32:36.970
What's this supposed to mean?

00:32:37.070 --> 00:32:38.790
I saw the announcement.

00:32:38.790 --> 00:32:40.350
Officer Li has officially

00:32:40.350 --> 00:32:41.480
joined the police station,

00:32:41.480 --> 00:32:43.000
and he'll be in charge of our area.

00:32:43.000 --> 00:32:45.030
That's something worth celebrating,
isn't it?

00:32:45.030 --> 00:32:45.610
So I thought

00:32:45.610 --> 00:32:47.180
I should come by on behalf of the hotel

00:32:47.180 --> 00:32:48.980
to congratulate you two.

00:32:48.980 --> 00:32:50.180
Thank you. Thank you.

00:32:50.180 --> 00:32:51.250
Go find a basin
and put it in water right away.

00:32:51.250 --> 00:32:51.750
Alright, alright.

00:32:51.750 --> 00:32:53.790
It'll be a fresh and hearty dish
for dinner, right?

00:32:53.790 --> 00:32:56.350
Alright, alright.
We appreciate the gesture.

00:32:56.350 --> 00:32:57.140
Thank you.

00:32:57.140 --> 00:32:57.960
Goodbye.

00:32:58.030 --> 00:32:59.550
Mrs. Sun.

00:32:59.900 --> 00:33:01.010
I'm not done yet.

00:33:01.010 --> 00:33:02.870
I want to have a word with Li Cheng.

00:33:03.500 --> 00:33:04.110
You...

00:33:04.590 --> 00:33:07.120
What could you two possibly have
to talk about?

00:33:07.120 --> 00:33:08.500
I just remembered something

00:33:08.500 --> 00:33:09.880
about Song.

00:33:10.000 --> 00:33:11.460
If it's about Song,

00:33:11.460 --> 00:33:12.740
go talk to the police.

00:33:12.740 --> 00:33:14.300
Why come to my son?

00:33:14.320 --> 00:33:15.810
Mrs. Sun, come on.

00:33:15.810 --> 00:33:18.050
Your son is a police officer now,
isn't he?

00:33:18.050 --> 00:33:20.450
He hasn't officially joined the force yet.

00:33:20.460 --> 00:33:21.850
There's plenty he can't handle.

00:33:21.850 --> 00:33:23.610
Manager Zhang, thank you. You should go.

00:33:23.610 --> 00:33:24.790
Mom. Mom.

00:33:25.030 --> 00:33:25.850
It's okay.

00:33:25.850 --> 00:33:28.110
I'll just have a word with Manager Zhang.

00:33:28.550 --> 00:33:29.840
Mind your own business, alright?

00:33:29.840 --> 00:33:31.780
Mom, I'm a police officer.

00:33:34.960 --> 00:33:36.170
Let's talk downstairs.

00:33:36.170 --> 00:33:37.490
Okay, sure.

00:33:40.980 --> 00:33:43.050
Mrs. Sun, don't overthink it.

00:33:43.050 --> 00:33:44.180
Just a quick chat.

00:33:44.200 --> 00:33:45.800
A-Am I a bad guy or something?

00:33:51.050 --> 00:33:52.380
Here, have a cigarette.

00:33:52.400 --> 00:33:53.300
I don't smoke.

00:33:54.300 --> 00:33:55.140
That's good.

00:33:55.170 --> 00:33:57.240
Smoking is bad for your health, after all.

00:33:57.240 --> 00:33:58.270
Manager Zhang,

00:33:58.300 --> 00:33:59.900
just say what you have to say.

00:34:00.030 --> 00:34:01.190
I'm your junior.

00:34:01.330 --> 00:34:02.810
No need for these formalities.

00:34:02.810 --> 00:34:03.570
Right, right. Well,

00:34:03.570 --> 00:34:05.570
it's become an occupational habit.

00:34:06.350 --> 00:34:07.350
Here's the thing.

00:34:07.960 --> 00:34:08.650
I remembered something

00:34:08.650 --> 00:34:10.250
over the past couple of days.

00:34:10.650 --> 00:34:12.170
Toward the end of last year,

00:34:12.170 --> 00:34:14.690
there was a guy who got into
a really heated argument

00:34:14.690 --> 00:34:15.900
with Song, Song Laifu.

00:34:15.900 --> 00:34:18.429
They were practically about to
come to blows.

00:34:18.840 --> 00:34:19.880
From what my mom told me,

00:34:19.880 --> 00:34:21.760
Song had a pretty bad temper.

00:34:21.780 --> 00:34:24.020
Didn't stuff like that happen
all the time?

00:34:24.020 --> 00:34:25.820
This guy was different, though.

00:34:26.030 --> 00:34:27.960
He wasn't a hotel guest.

00:34:27.960 --> 00:34:29.000
He was...

00:34:29.380 --> 00:34:31.400
I think he was Chen Chunli's nephew

00:34:32.460 --> 00:34:34.100
Chen Chunli's nephew?

00:34:34.989 --> 00:34:36.320
Are you sure about that?

00:34:37.070 --> 00:34:39.420
Well, I'm not entirely sure.

00:34:39.530 --> 00:34:41.190
I only heard it from Sun Qiang.

00:34:41.239 --> 00:34:42.260
You can go ask him.

00:34:42.260 --> 00:34:44.190
You two know each other, don't you?

00:34:45.050 --> 00:34:47.300
Why not go to the police station
and give them this lead?

00:34:47.300 --> 00:34:49.699
I haven't officially joined the force yet.

00:34:50.340 --> 00:34:51.580
Well... Well,

00:34:51.600 --> 00:34:53.030
you've got to understand.

00:34:53.030 --> 00:34:54.630
If I go to the police station,

00:34:54.630 --> 00:34:57.090
I'll have to give a statement
and all that. And...

00:34:57.090 --> 00:34:57.800
And what if

00:34:57.800 --> 00:35:00.000
this guy really did kill Song?

00:35:00.030 --> 00:35:01.340
I'm worried he might come after me.

00:35:01.340 --> 00:35:03.940
I've got a wife and kids.
I'm worried, you know?

00:35:04.560 --> 00:35:06.010
Then why didn't you say anything before?

00:35:06.010 --> 00:35:07.870
Why bring it up all of a sudden now?

00:35:08.690 --> 00:35:12.530
I really hadn't thought of it.

00:35:12.780 --> 00:35:14.030
You know, once you hit middle age,

00:35:14.030 --> 00:35:15.980
your memory isn't
as sharp as young people's.

00:35:15.980 --> 00:35:17.000
And I've got so much going on
at the hotel,

00:35:17.000 --> 00:35:18.420
I can barely keep up.

00:35:22.510 --> 00:35:23.640
Give me your number.

00:35:23.730 --> 00:35:24.530
If we need you to come to

00:35:24.530 --> 00:35:26.210
the police station for a statement later,

00:35:26.210 --> 00:35:27.540
you'll still have to go.

00:35:28.320 --> 00:35:29.170
Okay, okay.

00:35:29.190 --> 00:35:30.550
If you insist,

00:35:30.550 --> 00:35:31.710
of course I'll cooperate.

00:35:31.710 --> 00:35:35.040
But if you can avoid calling me in,
I'd really appreciate it.

00:35:55.460 --> 00:35:56.760
Do you know "Mr. San"?

00:35:57.980 --> 00:35:58.940
Yes, I do.

00:35:59.330 --> 00:36:00.730
He's Mr. Liu from downstairs.

00:36:00.730 --> 00:36:02.260
Everyone calls him Mr. San,

00:36:02.580 --> 00:36:03.870
or Master San.

00:36:05.380 --> 00:36:06.820
Do you know Song Laifu?

00:36:07.530 --> 00:36:08.880
Never heard of him.

00:36:09.110 --> 00:36:11.370
A security guard at Huangzhiyuan Hotel.

00:36:11.840 --> 00:36:12.770
I don't know him.

00:36:28.610 --> 00:36:29.670
What's this about?

00:36:31.310 --> 00:36:32.360
What's wrong?

00:36:32.460 --> 00:36:34.190
Why did you suddenly start whistling?

00:36:34.190 --> 00:36:35.520
Is that against the law?

00:36:36.720 --> 00:36:38.920
You seem pretty pleased with yourself.

00:36:39.660 --> 00:36:41.180
I just miss my mom.

00:36:43.860 --> 00:36:45.040
Can I continue?

00:36:45.130 --> 00:36:46.030
Sure.

00:36:46.980 --> 00:36:49.840
If the law doesn't prohibit it,
you're free to do it.

00:36:50.870 --> 00:36:51.580
Thank you.

00:37:02.480 --> 00:37:04.340
You suspect your mom

00:37:04.360 --> 00:37:06.190
was killed by Du Juan?

00:37:07.010 --> 00:37:07.780
It must be him.

00:37:07.780 --> 00:37:10.270
He definitely knows what happened.

00:37:10.290 --> 00:37:11.360
It wasn't a coincidence.

00:37:11.360 --> 00:37:12.630
The drunk driver who killed my mom

00:37:12.630 --> 00:37:13.970
was hired by Du Juan.

00:37:14.000 --> 00:37:15.270
It was Du Juan who killed my mom.

00:37:15.270 --> 00:37:17.040
She's the real murderer.